+# Feature Specification: Long-stay discount
+
+**Created**: 2026-11-20
+**Status**: Implemented
+**Input**: A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price. Quotes and bookings both show the reduced total.
+
+## Requirements
+
+- **FR-001**: Days = (end - start) / 1 day. When days >= 3, total = 90% of days x dailyPrice, rounded to whole cents.
+- **FR-002**: When days < 3, total is unchanged (days x dailyPrice).
+- **FR-003**: `quote` and `book` return the same discounted total (shared pricing).
+- **FR-004**: Overlap rules, validation and the safe-integer check on the full price are unchanged.
+
+## Assumptions
+
+- The discount applies to the whole rental, not only to days beyond the second.
+- Rounding: half up to the nearest cent (e.g. full price 7650 -> 6885; 1005 x 3 = 3015 -> 2713.5 -> 2714).
+
+## Acceptance
+
+1. 2 days at 2550 -> 5100 (no discount).
+2. 3 days at 2550 -> 6885, for both quote and book.
+3. 10 days at 1000 -> 9000.
